
# The blog example: a self-contained app package that consumes the @term/site framework.

deck @term/blog
  mark <0.0.1>
  # the entry `term boot` runs (its `boot` task): the Postgres-backed HTTP API. It and `book` sat at the top level,
  # outside `deck`, until 2026-10-22, where the manifest never read them, beside `back ./back`, `hook ./hook` and
  # `face ./face`, which are no manifest field
  boot ./hook/blog
  book ./book

load @term/site
  mark <0.0.x>
